      "writtenOn": "2020-04-09T17:38:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general, if your change is limited to one one functional area (such as USB), it\u0027s easier to review.\n\nMy suggestion is to move all the USB GPIOs into a different changelist.\nI2C related signals will be in another changelist.\nAnd sensor related signals in a another changelist.",
