      "writtenOn": "2020-04-08T20:34:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This GPIO needs to be moved to a different pin.  The PCH is not powered when the EC comes out of reset and will pull this pin to 0V.  This will cause the EC to float all the output and I/O pins.",
